24
00:01:52,060 --> 00:01:54,950
Demon Spirit Land
East Demon Spirit Sea

25
00:01:53,210 --> 00:01:56,070
How can the spiritual energy in here be so thin ?

26
00:01:55,850 --> 00:01:57,420
It’s no different from the mortal world.

27
00:01:57,890 --> 00:02:00,020
I don't know anything about this place

28
00:02:00,970 --> 00:02:03,220
