29
00:02:12,770 --> 00:02:13,860
Found it.

30
00:02:20,860 --> 00:02:23,150
Thirteen
Luo Family Tribe

31
00:02:29,410 --> 00:02:31,100
I’ve finally got you.

32
00:02:51,140 --> 00:02:52,990
Luo Family Valley

33
00:02:55,650 --> 00:02:57,460
This formation is exceedingly profound.

34
00:02:58,010 --> 00:02:59,900
It can conceal all signs of life.

35
00:03:00,410 --> 00:03:04,310
It was made with a different method than that of the Cultivation Alliance.

36
00:03:04,490 --> 00:03:06,900
It looks like the work of ancient cultivators.

37
00:03:09,850 --> 00:03:10,700
It’s him !

38
00:03:18,490 --> 00:03:19,660
Where are we ?

39
00:03:21,210 --> 00:03:23,100
And what is this formation guarding ?

40
00:03:23,850 --> 00:03:24,940
I won’t tell you.

41
00:03:25,250 --> 00:03:26,220
If you kill me,

42
00:03:26,330 --> 00:03:27,900
Patriarch Ouyang won’t let you go !

43
00:03:28,290 --> 00:03:29,660
I am Wang Lin,

44
00:03:30,650 --> 00:03:33,180
I request to speak with whoever owns this valley.

45
00:03:35,740 --> 00:03:37,910
Ouyang Hua
Luo Family Tribe Leader

46
00:03:36,370 --> 00:03:37,740
Outsider,

47
00:03:37,810 --> 00:03:39,660
return my tribe members

48
00:03:39,970 --> 00:03:41,700
and fuck off my tribe's territory !

49
00:03:50,010 --> 00:03:51,700
Don't come any closer !

50
00:03:52,290 --> 00:03:54,430
What you're looking for

51
00:03:54,210 --> 00:03:55,620
