52
00:03:57,170 --> 00:03:58,900
What I'm looking for ?

53
00:04:04,050 --> 00:04:05,140
An avatar ?

54
00:04:13,810 --> 00:04:14,660
Kill !

55
00:04:18,850 --> 00:04:20,980
This formation uses neither spiritual energy

56
00:04:21,290 --> 00:04:22,500
