57
00:04:23,730 --> 00:04:26,150
yet it somehow rivals my Ancient God Restrictions...

58
00:04:27,330 --> 00:04:28,380
Interesting.

59
00:04:30,130 --> 00:04:32,500
I thought you had more tricks up your sleeve

60
00:04:33,010 --> 00:04:34,620
