61
00:04:35,250 --> 00:04:36,660
Die !

62
00:04:45,530 --> 00:04:47,310
No matter how different, it's all the same.

63
00:04:47,090 --> 00:04:48,990
No matter how complex a formation is,

64
00:04:48,770 --> 00:04:50,980
it's always nothing more than a type of restriction.

65
00:04:51,330 --> 00:04:53,230
As long as I can understand it,

66
00:04:53,250 --> 00:04:55,190
it can be unraveled.

67
00:04:59,170 --> 00:05:00,220
Impossible !

68
00:05:00,530 --> 00:05:01,380
Celestial,

69
00:05:01,490 --> 00:05:03,740
you're actually breaking the formation !

70
00:05:04,890 --> 00:05:06,140
Spare me, Celestial !

71
00:05:06,570 --> 00:05:07,580
Ouyang Hua

72
00:05:07,730 --> 00:05:08,860
was wrong.

73
00:05:09,090 --> 00:05:11,220
This formation protects the lives of my tribe.

74
00:05:11,490 --> 00:05:13,270
I beg Celestial to understand,

75
00:05:13,050 --> 00:05:14,380
please don't destroy it.

76
00:05:26,650 --> 00:05:28,050
Open the gate.

77
00:05:43,170 --> 00:05:44,390
Celestial,

78
00:05:44,170 --> 00:05:45,110
please.

79
00:05:48,490 --> 00:05:50,500
They don't have a hint of spiritual energy

80
00:05:50,450 --> 00:05:52,300
