81
00:05:52,810 --> 00:05:54,140
It's really weird...

82
00:05:54,450 --> 00:05:55,740
What's the

83
00:05:56,370 --> 00:05:58,100
mystery of this valley ?

84
00:06:03,810 --> 00:06:06,340
Da Bao, Xiao Bao, come home for dinner !

85
00:06:16,890 --> 00:06:18,070
They’re...

86
00:06:18,330 --> 00:06:19,700
all mortals ?

87
00:06:23,210 --> 00:06:24,750
The child meant no offense,

88
00:06:24,530 --> 00:06:26,580
I hope Celestial doesn't mind.

89
00:06:27,330 --> 00:06:30,340
I assumed such a powerful formation had to be guarding something

90
00:06:31,330 --> 00:06:33,580
but it’s just a village of mortals.

91
00:06:35,250 --> 00:06:37,430
This jade bottle contains several dozen pills

92
00:06:37,330 --> 00:06:38,980
to strengthen your foundation.

93
00:06:39,130 --> 00:06:40,630
I'm sorry for bothering you,

94
00:06:40,650 --> 00:06:42,190
I shall take my leave now.

95
00:06:45,210 --> 00:06:46,300
Celestial, please wait !

96
00:06:47,330 --> 00:06:49,020
The Demon Spirit Night is about to begin.

97
00:06:49,370 --> 00:06:50,980
It's already dusk.

98
00:06:51,210 --> 00:06:52,900
If Celestial doesn’t mind,

99
00:06:53,650 --> 00:06:55,220
