103
00:07:05,370 --> 00:07:06,940
come out to hunt

104
00:07:07,210 --> 00:07:10,340
and kill every living thing in sight.

105
00:07:10,930 --> 00:07:12,260
Over time,

106
00:07:12,650 --> 00:07:14,460
people began calling this night

107
00:07:14,450 --> 00:07:16,500
the Demon Spirit Night.

108
00:07:17,450 --> 00:07:19,380
Legend has it that countless years ago,

109
00:07:19,890 --> 00:07:23,340
a celestial brought our ancestors here to settle

110
00:07:23,770 --> 00:07:25,740
and laid down this formation

111
00:07:26,170 --> 00:07:29,820
to spare us from the scourge of the Demon Spirit Nights.

112
00:07:30,450 --> 00:07:31,900
Patriarch Huanglong ?

113
00:07:33,130 --> 00:07:35,460
How do you know the name of Celestial Huang Long ?

114
00:07:35,530 --> 00:07:37,220
Do you know him ?

115
00:07:37,660 --> 00:07:38,510
No.

116
00:07:39,850 --> 00:07:42,660
The Huanglong I knew was only at Foundation Establishment.

117
00:07:43,250 --> 00:07:45,420
He can't be the same person as this painting.

118
00:07:46,330 --> 00:07:47,620
I have another question.

119
00:07:47,890 --> 00:07:48,900
You said that

120
00:07:49,090 --> 00:07:51,270
this place doesn’t have what I'm looking for.

121
00:07:51,330 --> 00:07:52,580
What is it exactly ?

122
00:07:56,930 --> 00:07:59,580
That item is tied to the life of my tribe.

123
00:08:00,050 --> 00:08:01,940
If you take it by force,

124
00:08:02,010 --> 00:08:04,190
it will hurt our tribe members' foundations

125
00:08:03,970 --> 00:08:06,390
and they may even wither and die.

126
00:08:06,650 --> 00:08:07,990
That's why

127
00:08:07,970 --> 00:08:12,100
I tried to stop you from entering the tribe.

128
00:08:13,410 --> 00:08:14,180
However,

129
00:08:14,410 --> 00:08:17,260
