130
00:08:17,370 --> 00:08:19,740
to strengthen our tribe members' foundations,

131
00:08:20,650 --> 00:08:23,700
we would willingly give Celestial what he's looking for.

132
00:08:24,850 --> 00:08:26,390
Is this enough ?

133
00:08:27,010 --> 00:08:28,700
Yes... it's enough !

134
00:08:29,050 --> 00:08:30,420
Thank you, Celestial.

135
00:08:30,930 --> 00:08:32,300
An outsider’s pills

136
00:08:32,770 --> 00:08:35,060
