137
00:08:35,450 --> 00:08:36,420
Celestial,

138
00:08:36,450 --> 00:08:37,780
please follow me.

139
00:08:37,930 --> 00:08:39,580
I’ll take you to it.

140
00:08:38,820 --> 00:08:42,150
Back mountain
of the Luo Family Tribe

141
00:08:45,450 --> 00:08:46,830
This fluctuation

142
00:08:46,930 --> 00:08:48,510
isn't celestial spiritual energy.

143
00:08:48,530 --> 00:08:49,980
Celestial's eye is keen.

144
00:08:50,210 --> 00:08:51,830
This isn't celestial spiritual energy.

145
00:08:51,730 --> 00:08:54,540
It's the unique demonic energy of the Demon Spirit Land.

146
00:08:54,660 --> 00:08:57,870
Rank 1 Demon Spirit Crystal

147
00:08:54,610 --> 00:08:56,060
What you're looking for

148
00:08:56,130 --> 00:08:59,470
