149
00:08:59,650 --> 00:09:02,380
No wonder he showed no hints of spiritual energy

150
00:09:03,250 --> 00:09:05,460
but was able to operate the formation.

151
00:09:05,930 --> 00:09:07,670
The Demon Spirit Crystal

152
00:09:07,610 --> 00:09:10,540
must be the key in this Demon Spirit Land.

153
00:09:20,690 --> 00:09:21,900
I will cultivate here.

154
00:09:22,810 --> 00:09:24,070
You may leave.

155
00:09:23,970 --> 00:09:24,780
Understood.

156
00:09:38,810 --> 00:09:40,470
We'll make it through the night

157
00:09:40,250 --> 00:09:41,500
and we'll survive !

158
00:09:44,050 --> 00:09:46,590
The demon spirits seem unusually fierce tonight.

159
00:09:47,170 --> 00:09:49,020
If the formation can’t hold,

160
00:09:49,370 --> 00:09:50,220
will...

161
00:09:51,210 --> 00:09:52,860
Will he help us ?

162
00:10:07,770 --> 00:10:08,460
Patriarch !

163
00:10:09,010 --> 00:10:11,270
Why is the demonic energy so strong tonight ?

164
00:10:11,090 --> 00:10:12,700
How can it be this powerful !?

165
00:10:14,250 --> 00:10:14,980
Hold the line !

166
00:10:15,770 --> 00:10:16,580
What do we do ?

167
00:10:17,450 --> 00:10:18,500
Don’t panic !

168
00:10:30,850 --> 00:10:31,900
It’s over !

169
00:10:32,850 --> 00:10:34,540
We’re all doomed !

170
00:10:39,010 --> 00:10:39,860
Celestial !

171
00:10:39,610 --> 00:10:40,820
The Celestial has come !

172
00:10:57,130 --> 00:10:58,550
Return to the valley !

173
00:11:00,450 --> 00:11:02,300
Whoever you are,

174
00:11:02,370 --> 00:11:03,580
show yourself !

175
00:11:12,290 --> 00:11:13,580
Your cultivation isn't bad

176
00:11:14,410 --> 00:11:16,620
