177
00:11:14,340 --> 00:11:16,750
Luo Yun
Heavenly Ghost Sect
Peak Late stage Soul Transformation

178
00:11:21,290 --> 00:11:23,420
Are you from the Da Lou Sword Sect ?

179
00:11:25,970 --> 00:11:27,820
Out of respect for your sect,

180
00:11:28,250 --> 00:11:30,430
if you hand over your Demon Spirit Crystal,

181
00:11:30,330 --> 00:11:31,940
I’ll spare your life.

182
00:11:34,330 --> 00:11:36,420
That's what you get for refusing my kindness !

183
00:11:39,530 --> 00:11:40,980
Death Finger !

184
00:11:48,730 --> 00:11:49,820
This spell...

185
00:11:50,330 --> 00:11:52,780
It's the same one that I saw at the All-Seer's birthday...

186
00:11:53,490 --> 00:11:54,380
You

187
00:11:54,290 --> 00:11:56,820
are the All-Seer's new disciple !

188
00:11:57,330 --> 00:11:58,860
The Seventh Purple Disciple,

189
00:11:59,650 --> 00:12:00,940
Wang Lin !

190
00:12:01,850 --> 00:12:03,580
This man can fight an Ascendant...

191
00:12:03,690 --> 00:12:04,980
If I knew it was him,

192
00:12:05,330 --> 00:12:06,860
I wouldn't have provoked him.

193
00:12:09,050 --> 00:12:10,540
You can’t escape.

194
00:12:12,450 --> 00:12:14,060
Even if you’re a prodigy,

195
00:12:14,730 --> 00:12:16,790
you’re only at Middle stage Soul Transformation !

196
00:12:17,450 --> 00:12:18,460
You

197
00:12:18,810 --> 00:12:20,420
are pushing your luck !

198
00:12:24,010 --> 00:12:25,140
Forbidden Devil,

199
00:12:25,530 --> 00:12:28,220
Fourth Heavenly Ghost !

200
00:12:52,970 --> 00:12:54,980
You forced me to wound my own Origin Soul

201
00:12:54,970 --> 00:12:56,540
and use a forbidden spell !

202
00:12:56,810 --> 00:12:57,940
You deserve

203
00:12:58,370 --> 00:12:59,580
to die !

204
00:13:06,730 --> 00:13:07,780
A soul ?

205
00:13:09,490 --> 00:13:10,860
It was about time.

206
00:13:21,570 --> 00:13:24,230
This will allow the Soul Lasher to evolve.

207
00:13:24,130 --> 00:13:26,140
The Heavenly Ghost’s soul

208
00:13:26,290 --> 00:13:28,580
will feed the Soul Lasher !

209
00:13:32,050 --> 00:13:33,780
An artifact specialized in damaging souls ?

210
00:13:54,930 --> 00:13:56,780
Welcome back, Celestial !

211
00:13:57,050 --> 00:13:59,220
Welcome back, Celestial !

212
00:13:59,530 --> 00:14:01,350
I’ll borrow your back mountain.

213
00:14:01,290 --> 00:14:02,500
Don't disturb me

214
00:14:03,050 --> 00:14:04,260
unless it’s urgent.

215
00:14:07,850 --> 00:14:09,180
From now on,

216
00:14:09,210 --> 00:14:11,060
the back mountain is a forbidden area.

217
00:14:11,250 --> 00:14:12,380
It's off limits !

218
00:14:12,970 --> 00:14:14,380
This is the tribe's rule.

219
00:14:14,930 --> 00:14:16,190
Those who violate it

220
00:14:16,090 --> 00:14:17,870
will be banished outside

221
00:14:17,650 --> 00:14:18,980
to fend for themselves !

222
00:14:19,090 --> 00:14:20,100
Understood.

223
00:14:27,810 --> 00:14:30,460
Disciples of the Heavenly Ghost Sect are protected by ghost spirits.

224
00:14:31,010 --> 00:14:32,260
If you kill me,

225
00:14:32,610 --> 00:14:35,460
my master, Daoist Ghost, will avenge me !

226
00:14:36,170 --> 00:14:38,300
Even the All-Seer

227
00:14:38,530 --> 00:14:41,500
treats my master as a peer !

228
00:14:42,170 --> 00:14:43,220
Wang Lin,

229
00:14:43,330 --> 00:14:45,060
think carefully !

230
00:14:48,770 --> 00:14:51,020
You dare to Soul Search me !?

231
00:14:51,410 --> 00:14:54,820
My master will never let you go !

232
00:14:59,890 --> 00:15:02,470
The Demon Spirit Land is divided into 9 countries.

233
00:15:02,450 --> 00:15:04,340
Each country is ruled by a Demon Emperor

234
00:15:05,130 --> 00:15:07,180
and has over 100 cities governed by

235
00:15:07,610 --> 00:15:10,060
8 Demon Generals under the Demon Emperor.

236
00:15:10,850 --> 00:15:12,340
These 9 countries

237
00:15:12,730 --> 00:15:15,750
each belong to one of the 9 Ancient Demon Spirits

238
00:15:15,570 --> 00:15:17,380
that live in this place.

239
00:15:19,010 --> 00:15:21,310
Fusing with an Ancient Demon Spirit

240
00:15:21,530 --> 00:15:24,660
is the true goal of us cultivators.

241
00:15:25,770 --> 00:15:29,630
Ancient Demon Spirits are naturally born of heaven and earth.

242
00:15:29,530 --> 00:15:31,710
If a cultivator fuses with one,

243
00:15:31,610 --> 00:15:33,590
not only will their cultivation surge

244
00:15:33,370 --> 00:15:35,420
but they’ll also gain heaven-defying abilities.

245
00:15:36,610 --> 00:15:39,070
Luo Yun’s memories even mention a rumor.

246
00:15:38,890 --> 00:15:40,620
Those who fuse with an Ancient Demon Spirit

247
00:15:41,010 --> 00:15:42,220
have a tiny chance

248
00:15:42,450 --> 00:15:45,140
of entering a state known as the Beginning of the Soul.

249
00:15:46,410 --> 00:15:47,740
Beginning of the Soul ?

250
00:15:48,810 --> 00:15:49,820
Could it be...

251
00:15:50,130 --> 00:15:51,540
the Shi Realm ?

252
00:15:51,810 --> 00:15:56,700
Ji Realm

253
00:15:51,820 --> 00:15:56,710
Shi Realm

254
00:15:53,820 --> 00:15:56,710
Dao Realm

255
00:15:52,850 --> 00:15:56,260
The 3 legendary realms involve spiritual energy and Divine Sense.

256
00:15:57,170 --> 00:15:59,150
If I grasp Death from the Ji Realm

257
00:15:59,170 --> 00:16:00,900
and Life from the Shi Realm,

258
00:16:01,370 --> 00:16:03,750
my Dao of Life and Death

259
00:16:03,530 --> 00:16:05,620
might one day reach a higher state.

260
00:16:08,010 --> 00:16:10,740
It's too early to be thinking about this.

261
00:16:11,850 --> 00:16:13,020
According to Luo Yun,

262
00:16:13,410 --> 00:16:15,020
only with enough demonic energy

263
00:16:15,410 --> 00:16:17,140
and by accumulating military merit

264
00:16:17,690 --> 00:16:20,620
can one earn an audience with the Ancient Demon Spirit.

265
00:16:21,930 --> 00:16:23,580
I'm currently in the Sky Demon Country

266
00:16:24,170 --> 00:16:26,460
and the nearest city is Ancient Demon City.

267
00:16:27,370 --> 00:16:28,820
Luo Yun invaded the valley

268
00:16:29,130 --> 00:16:31,300
for this rank 1 Demon Spirit Crystal

269
00:16:31,460 --> 00:16:34,270
Rank 2 Demon Spirit Crystal

270
00:16:31,650 --> 00:16:34,260
to merge it with his rank 2 crystal

271
00:16:34,490 --> 00:16:37,390
and gain qualifications to enter Ancient Demon City.

272
00:16:34,380 --> 00:16:37,550
Rank 3 Demon Spirit Crystal

273
00:16:37,770 --> 00:16:39,660
Then, as a soldier in the army,

274
00:16:40,090 --> 00:16:42,460
he would join in campaigns

275
00:16:43,010 --> 00:16:44,460
to accumulate merit

276
00:16:45,450 --> 00:16:47,270
and rise through the ranks.

277
00:16:47,410 --> 00:16:50,380
This is the path most cultivators will choose to follow.

278
00:16:57,370 --> 00:16:59,340
But joining the army as a soldier

279
00:16:59,610 --> 00:17:01,670
would leave me at the mercy of others.

280
00:17:01,970 --> 00:17:02,860
In that case,

281
00:17:03,370 --> 00:17:06,470
it might be better to teach the tribe how to make Soul Flags

282
00:17:06,450 --> 00:17:09,180
to build an army of my own.

283
00:17:14,670 --> 00:19:19,190
Quick reminder of the 3 legendary realms of spiritual energy and Divine Sense because it was never really explained in the donghua.

- The Ji Realm, the extreme realm that grants unprecedented power and represents Death.
- The Shi Realm, if Ji is Death then Shi is Life.
- The Dao Realm, the most sought after and the most mysterious.

Wang Lin lacks information at the moment about the Shi and Dao Realms.

284
00:17:20,380 --> 00:17:26,270
I've been walking this path for endless years

285
00:17:22,680 --> 00:17:26,270
just to catch a glimpse of your silhouette.

286
00:17:26,660 --> 00:17:31,870
Is it the compass of fate

287
00:17:28,500 --> 00:17:31,870
that wrote this outcome for us ?

288
00:17:31,780 --> 00:17:37,790
The heavens want to erase your existence,

289
00:17:37,660 --> 00:17:43,510
that's the obsession guiding me.

290
00:17:43,540 --> 00:17:49,110
Is this the path to uncover

291
00:17:45,420 --> 00:17:49,110
truths from falsehoods ?

292
00:17:49,140 --> 00:17:54,710
In a world of murk and shadow,

293
00:17:51,040 --> 00:17:54,710
only the flame of truth can light the way.

294
00:17:54,500 --> 00:18:00,430
Look at them all,

295
00:17:57,380 --> 00:18:00,430
being carried by the waves.

296
00:18:00,620 --> 00:18:05,070
Look at them all,

297
00:18:02,780 --> 00:18:05,070
being drowned.

298
00:18:04,900 --> 00:18:08,390
I don't want to believe in whoever decides fate,

299
00:18:08,180 --> 00:18:11,470
I will let the world refine my soul.

300
00:18:11,350 --> 00:18:17,030
So what if I become an Immortal and defy the heavens ?

301
00:18:13,040 --> 00:18:17,030
I will fight.

302
00:18:16,780 --> 00:18:20,150
I'll break through the abyss of despair

303
00:18:19,900 --> 00:18:23,190
to finally learn who I really am.

304
00:18:22,940 --> 00:18:28,550
My body is stained by the bloody color of slaughter,

305
00:18:24,820 --> 00:18:28,550
I embrace this obsession.

306
00:18:28,300 --> 00:18:31,510
I won't glance back at the wasteland I left behind.

307
00:18:31,260 --> 00:18:34,310
Even if this suffering shatters my soul

308
00:18:34,060 --> 00:18:39,790
and I'm reborn countless times in hell,

309
00:18:36,100 --> 00:18:39,790
I'll still fight.

310
00:18:39,740 --> 00:18:43,150
It's hard to avoid loneliness

311
00:18:42,900 --> 00:18:46,190
when you are above everyone else.

312
00:18:45,940 --> 00:18:51,870
Can a moth that has witnessed the flames of a Suzaku

313
00:18:48,260 --> 00:18:51,870
be afraid of a firefly ?
